ference, workspace/agent/session model, per-workspace mount path, .sandbox startup, review/fix/landing loop and gotchas into scripts/agent-sandbox.md, checked against the current scripts. The charter retains state, decisions and historical record and links to the guide. Moved all three specified documents to docs/history, preserving their frontmatter metadata and rebasing source/link paths; updated incoming links including the link-only DECISIONS edits. Updated docs/index.md, README.md and WORKTREES.md so the sandbox owns parallel agent work and worktrees describe human branches. Archived archive, direct-delivery, spec-releases and unified-workspace-root with clearhead archive charter. Core gate passed; doctor remains at the same three pre-existing New-charter warnings and zero violations. Markdown LSP checks were attempted but unavailable. No new dependencies, code changes or Containerfile changes.$ !2 ^2026-09-30T15:27 %2026-09-30T22:36 #01a0f46e-42e1-77b3-961e-ee6774c29cc1
[x] Decide where decisions live $FOR THE HUMAN. CONTRIBUTING's 'Where knowledge lives' says platform decisions go in docs/DECISIONS.md and not in actions or charters, but since Decision 41 (2026-09-22) every decision has been written in the action or charter that made it. Options: (a, recommended) change the rule to match practice: a decision lives with the charter or action that made it, and DECISIONS.md keeps only cross-cutting architecture decisions as short entries linking to where the reasoning lives; (b) backfill DECISIONS.md and keep the rule. Answer with a or b; the orchestrator then updates CONTRIBUTING and the open support action about per-repo DECISIONS.md files. ANSWERED 2026-09-30 by the human: decisions go in the docs folder of the project they bind, which is the existing CONTRIBUTING rule (project → its docs/DECISIONS.md, cross-repo → platform docs/DECISIONS.md); what changes is practice: stop writing decisions into actions and charter logs. Applied the same day: ontology/docs/DECISIONS.md created (Decisions 1-3), platform Decision 42.$ !2 +human ^2026-09-30T16:32 %2026-09-30T23:39 #01a0f4aa-0b3c-766a-978c-efe06eb3f3f9
