date (workspace/transaction.rs, NormalizedOperation::Update). Closed lines in the active file make this reachable, so update-action must refuse them with AlreadyClosed, in the transaction and in the ordinary verb, with a test. Close outcomes emit open_children and no children, per the specification's result schema.$ !2 ^2026-11-02T02:43 %2026-11-02T07:00 #01a19a23-87b5-7c40-a279-93920a7966ee
